sing is the optimal strategic move. Using RedJoker to beat a lowly ♣6 would be a catastrophic waste of my most powerful card. Playing ♦Q is slightly better but still gives away control prematurely. By passing, I force the peasants to continue their battle, potentially making them waste cards on each other. I\'m already in a strong position with fewer cards than both opponents, so patience and card preservation are key.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
